 ⚖️ Situational awareness: The House yesterday voted to hold Leon Black in contempt, which could set the stage for federal criminal prosecution.

 Black, the billionaire founder and former CEO of Apollo Global Management, recently refused to appear in front of the House Oversight Committee for a second round of questions over his ties to Jeffrey Epstein. He also refused to comply with a subpoena for copies of NDAs to which he's been a party. 🤖 You're invited: Ajay Agarwal of Bain Capital Ventures will join me on stage in Boston on Sept. 29 for our "AI Across America" event. Just yesterday, BCV announced that it's raised $1.6 billion for its 11th fund. Register here .

 
 
 
 
 
 
 
 
 
