 Venture Capital Deals 
 
 
 &nbsp; 
 
 🚀 Impulse Space , a developer of highly maneuverable spacecraft, raised $308m in Series D extension funding (round total $808m) from 137 Ventures, BANNER VC, DFJ Growth, Linse Capital, Lux Capital, and Valor Equity Partners. axios.link/4y2MnnA 

 ⚡ Mazama Energy , a Frisco, Texas-based superhot geothermal energy developer, raised $135m in Series B funding and grants, per Axios Pro . Centaurus Capital and Doerr Capital led, joined by ConocoPhillips, Shell Ventures, SiteGround Capital, H. Barton Asset Management, the Jeffrey and Marieke Rothschild Foundation, Khosla Ventures and Gates Frontier. axios.link/4gZmRth 

 🚑 Sling Therapeutics , an Ann Arbor, Mich.-based developer of oral treatments for thyroid eye disease, raised $123m in Series C funding. Forbion led, joined by TPG Life Sciences Innovations and Sectoral Asset Management. axios.link/4hds4g2 

 • Hang Ten Systems , a Palo Alto, Calif.-based AI services adoption company, raised $53m in new seed funding (round total now $85m). Xora led, joined by Mayfield, Aramco Ventures, Sanjay Mehrotra, and Jerry Yang. axios.link/4cP2vk9 

 • Luzern Risk , an NYC-based captive insurance platform, raised $45m in Series B funding, per Axios Pro . Insight Partners led, joined by Trust Ventures and insider Caffeinated Capital. axios.link/4hdjjTh 

 • BackOps , an SF-based supply chain management startup, raised $42m in Series B funding. Insight Partners led, joined by Theory Ventures, Construct Capital, Gradient Ventures, and 10VC. axios.link/3TdFHnt 

 • Noetive , an SF-based developer of self-improving AI for physical industries, emerged from stealth with $41m. Eclipse led, joined by Craft Ventures, The Westly Group, Swish Ventures, Factory, Incite Ventures, Gigascale Capital, Operator Partners, and Liquid 2 Ventures. axios.link/4Aiuv9N 

 ⚡ Rune , a developer of solar power solutions for data centers, raised $40m in Series A funding. Spark Capital led, joined by Union Square Ventures, Lowercarbon Capital, Activate Capital, Committed Capital, Timeless Partners, and Logos Fund. axios.link/4AeDQiK 

 • TypeSafe AI , an SF-based composable AI startup led by OpenAI vet Diogo Almeida, raised $40m in seed funding led by DCVC . axios.link/3ViVy4J 

 • Comp AI , a security and compliance platform, raised $34m led by Roo Capital and Grand Ventures . axios.link/4izAWii 

 • Adaptive , a provider of accounting software to construction contractors, has raised $30m in Series B funding, per Axios Pro . Tidemark led, joined by insiders a16z, Emergence Capital, Pathlight, Definition, and 3KVC. axios.link/4xZfbx3 

 🚑 Altis Labs , a Canadian provider of AI software for drug development, raised US$25m in Series A funding, per Axios Pro. OrbiMed and Qiming Venture Partners USA led, joined by Innovation Endeavors, Benchstrength, Fusion Fund, and Cancer Breakthrough Fund. axios.link/4yBg9Q6 

 • Loora , an English-learning app, raised $22m in Series B funding. Union Tech Ventures led, joined by vgames, Emerge, Hearst Ventures, and QP Ventures. axios.link/4xp7Ndl 

 🚑 Polyphron , an NYC-based developer of human tissue models for drug development, raised $20m in seed funding, per Axios Pro . Quiet Capital led, joined by Gradient, Haystack, and Compound. axios.link/3VzyLBK 

 • Magentic , a London-based agentic platform for procurement data, raised $18m in Series A funding, per Axios Pro . Felicis led, joined by insiders Sequoia Capital and Westly Group. axios.link/46ymmAr 

 • Treble Technologies , a Reykjavik, Iceland-based developer of acoustic simulation for physical AI, raised $18m in Series A extension funding, per Axios Pro . Paladin Capital Group led, joined by insiders Kompas VC, Frumtak Ventures, and the EIC Fund. axios.link/4xyTfrI 

 ⚡ R3 Lithium , a Covington, Ga.-based battery recycling startup, raised $15m from TDK Ventures, Integral GlobalTech Partners, and Axial Partners. axios.link/3UZTcrk 

 • Tare , an NYC-based blockchain credit exchange, raised $13.25m in seed funding. Blockchain Capital led, joined by Strobe Ventures, Janus Henderson, Apollo Global Management, The Venture Dept, Neoclassic Capital, and Avalanche Foundation. axios.link/4hawwvZ 

 • MicroLub , a U.K. developer of protein-based ingredients, raised $10m led by Northern Gritstone . axios.link/472u85L 

 • Syte , a German real estate planning startup, raised €9m in Series A funding. Amberra led, joined by NRW.Bank, HTGF, Vent.io, and Vantage Value. axios.link/470QLYf 

 • Eterna Regeneratives , a developer of toothpaste derived from human hair, raised $4m led by Hoxton Ventures and The Venture Collective , per Tech.eu. axios.link/4Ag9uwh 

 
 
