 • Blackstone hired Goldman Sachs to sell the Asian business of U.K. events organizer Clarion Events , per Bloomberg. axios.link/470RJ6P 

 • May Mobility , an Ann Arbor, Mich.-based autonomous microtransit company, agreed to go public via a reverse merger with ACP Holdings Acquisition Corp. (Nasdaq: ACGCW), a SPAC affiliated with Atlas Credit Partners. May has raised over $300m from firms like NTT Group, Toyota Ventures, Aioi Nissay Dowa Insurance Co., State Farm Ventures, BMW i Ventures, Cyrus Capital, and Trucks VC. axios.link/3T3nHMz 

 ⚡ Plains All American Pipeline (Nasdaq: PAA) and Plains GP Holdings (Nasdaq: PAGP) agreed to acquire Silver Creek , a crude oil gathering system in the Powder River Basin, from Tailwater Capital and The Energy &amp; Minerals Group for $585m in cash. axios.link/3UUgQpm 

 
 
